<Information title="Terms of personal use" description="Personal-use scope of Pandora's Box and its Forge Gmail integration.">
  <p>Updated November 10, 2026. Pandora’s Box and its Forge Gmail connection are operated by Gabriel Andrade for his personal engineering and career workflows. This is not a publicly offered email service.</p>
  <h2>Authorization and review</h2>
  <p>Connecting Gmail requires the account owner’s consent. The integration reads relevant messages and records possible outcomes; classifications can be wrong and require human judgment. Gabriel remains responsible for reviewing materials, handling conversations, and making employment decisions.</p>
  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>The integration is provided as a personal tool without an availability guarantee. Access can be stopped or revoked at any time. It does not guarantee interviews, employment, or delivery of every notification.</p>
  <p>The <a href="/pandora/privacy/">privacy notice</a> describes Gmail data handling. Questions can be directed to Gabriel through his <a href="/#contact">published contact details</a>.</p>
</Information>
